@startuml
actor "Prospective Admin" as Admin
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Nexo API" as API
Admin -> UI: Submit organization and admin details
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /organizations (RegisterOrganizationDto)
activate API
API --> UI: 201 Created (OrganizationDto) or 400/409
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Show result and sign in on success
deactivate UI
@enduml
